  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "AlphaSolve for DSH",
      "text": "[中文使用说明](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nAlphaSolve helps you work on difficult mathematics problems in [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness): it develops candidate proofs, checks them independently, and revises them. It follows the workflow of [AlphaSolve](https://github.com/tanzcoding/alphasolve)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "These npm instructions apply to published `dsh-alphasolve@0.4.0` and DSH `0.2.0-rc.2`. The current source checkout targets DSH `0.2.2-rc.1` at the source commit recorded in [Compatibility](COMPATIBILITY.md); those changes are not yet published to npm. Use Node.js 24.9 or newer, a native tool executor, and [build both checkouts from source](docs/advanced.md#development-and-validation)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "1. Install **DeepSeek Harness Desktop 0.2.0-rc.2** and configure a working model connection.\n2. Open the plugin manager, choose **Add plugin**, enter **`dsh-alphasolve`**, and install. Choose **Enable now** and restart if prompted.\n3. Complete the [one-time Python/SymPy setup](docs/python-setup.md). Desktop includes Python, but installing the plugin does **not** install SymPy."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "The npm installation needs no GitHub account or source build. If you have the older `@dsh-external/dsh-alphasolve` package, [replace it before installing this one](docs/advanced.md#upgrading-from-the-github-package)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Solve a problem",
      "text": "1. Create a folder and put your question in **`problem.md`**. You may add **`hint.md`** for ideas, references, or approaches to try.\n2. Open that folder as a workspace in DSH and start a conversation in **standard** mode.\n3. Send:\n\n> Use AlphaSolve to solve the problem in problem.md.\n\nClick **AlphaSolve** at the top of the conversation to see progress and open each participant's working transcript. When the workflow accepts a solution, it writes **`solution.md`** in your folder."
    },
    {
      "section": "Solve a problem",
      "text": "Start with a small problem. Repeated checking can take a long time and incur substantial model charges; the default is two parallel solving tasks. Automated checks do not guarantee a correct proof—review the mathematics yourself.\n\n[npm package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-alphasolve) · [Advanced usage and development](docs/advanced.md) · [Compatibility](COMPATIBILITY.md) · [Report a problem](https://github.com/dxww123/dsh-alphasolve/issues)"
    },
    {
      "section": "AlphaSolve for DSH",
      "text": "[English](README.md)\n\n让 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 按照 [AlphaSolve](https://github.com/tanzcoding/alphasolve) 的流程研究数学问题：尝试证明、独立检查、反复修改。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "以下 npm 安装步骤适用于已发布的 `dsh-alphasolve@0.4.0` 和 DSH `0.2.0-rc.2`。当前源码面向 DSH `0.2.2-rc.1`，对应[兼容性说明](COMPATIBILITY.md)记录的源码提交；相关改动尚未发布到 npm。请使用 Node.js 24.9 或更新版本和 native 工具执行器，并[从源码构建两个仓库后本地安装](docs/advanced.zh-CN.md#开发与验证)。\n\n1. 安装 **DeepSeek Harness 官方桌面端 0.2.0-rc.2**，配置好可用的模型。\n2. 在插件管理中选择「添加插件」，输入 **`dsh-alphasolve`** 并安装，选择「立即启用」，按提示重启。\n3. 按照[首次计算环境准备](docs/python-setup.zh-CN.md)配置 Python/SymPy。桌面端自带 Python，但安装插件**不会自动安装 SymPy**。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "npm 安装不需要 GitHub 账号，也不需要下载源码、自己编译。已安装旧包 `@dsh-external/dsh-alphasolve` 的用户，请先按[升级说明](docs/advanced.zh-CN.md#从-github-旧包升级)替换旧包。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始求解",
      "text": "1. 新建一个文件夹，把题目写进 **`problem.md`**；如有思路、参考资料或想尝试的方法，可另外写进 **`hint.md`**。\n2. 在 DSH 中打开这个文件夹作为工作区，使用 **standard** 模式新建对话。\n3. 发送：\n\n> 用 AlphaSolve 求解 problem.md 中的问题。\n\n点击对话顶部的 **AlphaSolve**，可以查看进度和各个参与者的具体工作记录。工作流确认得到解答后，会把结果写入文件夹中的 **`solution.md`**。\n\n建议先用一道小题试试。多轮检查可能耗时很长、产生较多模型费用；默认同时运行两个求解任务。自动检查不能保证证明正确，结果仍需人工核验。\n\n[npm 包](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-alphasolve) · [进阶使用与开发](docs/advanced.zh-CN.md) · [兼容性说明](COMPATIBILITY.md) · [反馈问题](https://github.com/dxww123/dsh-alphasolve/issues)"
    }
